  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Productive Development Bank  for the deployment of the Eco-efficiency Credit Programme in Bolivia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Note: Disbursement data provided is cumulative and covers disbursement made by the project Agency.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The primary objective of this full-sized project is to achieve global environmental benefits by accelerating the adoption of low-emission and low-pollution technologies and practices in Bolivia&apos;s agriculture, livestock, manufacturing, tourism, and waste management sectors.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YesIndigenous communities*  While no indigenous communities have been identified in the project&apos;s area of influence, other vulnerable groups&#x2014;particularly women, youth, and informal workers&#x2014;must be considered due to their socioeconomic and cultural contexts.</narrative>
  </description>
